<title>USA: NBC to announce intl venture at press brief.</title>
<headline>NBC to announce intl venture at press brief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric Co's NBC unit will hold a telephone news conference on Wednesday at 1000 EST/1500 GMT to announce a new international joint venture.</p>
<p>NBC officials declined to give details of the venture.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, NBC declined to comment on a report that it was in talks to buy the USA Networks' three cable channels. Analysts said the transaction could be worth as much as $3 billion.</p>
<p>USA Networks is 50 percent owned by Viacom Inc and Seagram Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
